030","ordinal":233417,"en":"Day is clear, night is cloudy"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0623:b004:l031","ordinal":233418,"en":"The sun's rays are broken,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0623:b004:l032","ordinal":233419,"en":"Argyn and Kyrgyz"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0623:b004:l033","ordinal":233420,"en":"Let's join hands, strong fight"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0623:b004:l034","ordinal":233421,"en":"Come on, baby Kanykey,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0623:b004:l035","ordinal":233422,"en":"If you send a letter, send it quickly!\""},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0623:b004:l036","ordinal":233423,"en":"Until he closed his mouth,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0623:b004:l037","ordinal":233424,"en":"Before saying and closing his mouth,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0623:b004:l038","ordinal":233425,"en":"So-and-so"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0623:b004:l039","ordinal":233426,"en":"Until the population is safe"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b003:l001","ordinal":233427,"en":"The fugitive screamed,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b003:l002","ordinal":233428,"en":"Red blood, yellow blood"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b003:l003","ordinal":233429,"en":"Calling Kan Bakalay."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b003:l004","ordinal":233430,"en":"He screamed,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b003:l005","ordinal":233431,"en":"The screams broke the stone,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b003:l006","ordinal":233432,"en":"Yelling that Joo has arrived,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b003:l007","ordinal":233433,"en":"A clever thinker"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b003:l008","ordinal":233434,"en":"Calling to come out"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b003:l009","ordinal":233435,"en":"Your father's grave, Bakay blood,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b003:l010","ordinal":233436,"en":"Did you know what I know?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b003:l011","ordinal":233437,"en":"Did you see what I saw?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b003:l012","ordinal":233438,"en":"Is there a garden built by Ken-Kol,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b003:l013","ordinal":233439,"