35","ordinal":233461,"en":"I stood upside down,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b003:l036","ordinal":233462,"en":"Shooting a gun, shooting a bow,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b003:l037","ordinal":233463,"en":"I quarreled with each other."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b003:l038","ordinal":233464,"en":"Yellow blood alone, Chinese thousand"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b003:l039","ordinal":233465,"en":"I fought."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l001","ordinal":233466,"en":"I grieved against it,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l002","ordinal":233467,"en":"He was sitting down"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l003","ordinal":233468,"en":"Kalyk and Baitailak"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l004","ordinal":233469,"en":"I lost these two."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l005","ordinal":233470,"en":"Kamin, my father, Bakay,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l006","ordinal":233471,"en":"Blankets on the surface"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0624:b004:l007","ordinal":233472,"en":"It's going to come out."}]
